:null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":{"id":9619770,"node_id":"IT_kwDOAsRub84Aksk6","name":"Task","description":"A specific piece of work","color":"yellow","created_at":"2024-02-02T04:38:11Z","updated_at":"2024-07-26T12:32:49Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I wonder how hard could it be to integrate this GH CLI extension and run it in our test suite:\n* https://github.com/nektos/act\n* https://nektosact.com/installation/gh.html\n* https://nektosact.com/usage/index.html","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/40/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/40/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/35","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/35/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/35/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/35/events","html_url":"https://github.com/re-actors/alls-green/issues/35","id":3786735584,"node_id":"I_kwDOGeUlHs7htP_g","number":35,"title":"Summary cards are not configurable","user":{"login":"szczys","id":367685,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzY4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367685?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys","html_url":"https://github.com/szczys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3606977325,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGeUlHs7W_hst","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3606977334,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGeUlHs7W_hs2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/labels/question","name":"question","color":"d876e3","default":true,"description":"Further information is requested","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-01-06T22:30:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T11:37:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":{"id":9619776,"node_id":"IT_kwDOAsRub84AkslA","name":"Feature","description":"A request, idea, or new functionality","color":"blue","created_at":"2024-02-02T04:38:11Z","updated_at":"2024-10-08T14:55:33Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"We are using alls-green for a dozen or so verify steps in our workflow. This results in many different summary cards which for the most part (reporting successful matrix steps) obscure more useful information. This behavior should be configurable. I plan to open a pull request to address this.\n\n<img width=\"622\" height=\"780\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3c494c2-7971-4b9a-aa19-388977e8279d\" />","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/35/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/35/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/34","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/34/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/34/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/34/events","html_url":"https://github.com/re-actors/alls-green/issues/34","id":3676533528,"node_id":"I_kwDOGeUlHs7bI3MY","number":34,"title":"How to use with multiple workflow files?","user":{"login":"dkaszews","id":26599495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTk5NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26599495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews","html_url":"https://github.com/dkaszews","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkaszews/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-11-29T08:52:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T21:03:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I have my jobs split across multiple workflow files for organization: \n\n1. `actionlint.yaml` with job `actionlint`\n1. `format.yaml` with jobs `flake8` and `mypy`\n1. `test.yaml` with jobs `unit-test` and `integration-test`\n \nI have created a third file `required.yaml` with following:\n```yaml\nname: Required\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    branches:\n      - main\n  pull_request:\n\njobs:\n  required:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 10\n    if: always()\n    needs:\n      - actionlint\n      - flake8\n      - mypy\n      - unit-test\n      - integration-test\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: re-actors/alls-green@release/v1\n        with:\n          jobs: ${{ toJSON(needs) }}\n```\n\nBut the `Required` check gets skipped, while `Actionlint` fails with:\n\n> Error: .github/workflows/required.yaml:10:3: job \"required\" needs job \"actionlint\" which does not exist in this workflow [job-needs]\n\nI understand this means the `needs` only works in the same workflow file, so how do I check others? Do I need to duplicate the `required` job in every file?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/34/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/34/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"