lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This can happen if GHA definition is borked partially and GHA kinda skips a dependent job but doesn't mark it as such really.\r\n```json\r\n    \"build_windows\": {\r\n      \"result\": null,\r\n      \"outputs\": {}\r\n    },\r\n```\r\n*(https://github.com/python/cpython/actions/runs/9950331379/job/27488343862?pr=121831#step:2:62)*\r\n\r\nI think, we should output some hint informing the end-users that they need to review their workflow.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/30/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/30/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/28","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/28/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/28/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/28/events","html_url":"https://github.com/re-actors/alls-green/issues/28","id":2166896474,"node_id":"I_kwDOGeUlHs6BKDda","number":28,"title":"Feat: add the possibility to skip a failed test from a matrix","user":{"login":"alber70g","id":516972,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjk3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/516972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g","html_url":"https://github.com/alber70g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alber70g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3606977321,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGeUlHs7W_hsp","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Improvements or additions to documentation","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-03-04T13:49:52Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T14:50:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Imagine this\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\n  end-to-end-tests:\r\n    name: E2E - ${{ matrix.app }}\r\n    needs: build\r\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\r\n    strategy:\r\n      fail-fast: false\r\n      matrix:\r\n        app: ['tools', 'docs', 'app']\r\n```\r\n\r\nand the `ci-gate`\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\n  ci-gate:\r\n    if: always()\r\n    needs:\r\n      - build\r\n      - integration-tests\r\n      - end-to-end-tests\r\n    runs-on: Ubuntu-latest\r\n    steps:\r\n      - name: Check required jobs.\r\n        uses: re-actors/alls-green@release/v1\r\n        with:\r\n          jobs: ${{ toJSON(needs) }}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'd like to be able to \"allow-failed\" the `app` part of `end-to-end-tests`. Is that possible?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/28/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/28/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/26","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/26/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/26/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/issues/26/events","html_url":"https://github.com/re-actors/alls-green/issues/26","id":2024843199,"node_id":"I_kwDOGeUlHs54sKe_","number":26,"title":"Doc: how to make the CI look green","user":{"login":"LecrisUT","id":25577083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NTc3MDgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25577083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT","html_url":"https://github.com/LecrisUT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LecrisUT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3606977321,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGeUlHs7W_hsp","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/re-actors/alls-green/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"